anessa:</span> You mustn't jump the queue.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> The 'queue'?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> That means 'the line'. Also if you are there in February for Valentine's day you must be prepared. It's very seriously celebrated."}, {"time": "51000", "image": "engenn8le13ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> That won't make a difference to me.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> The last Valentine's I was there, things got really chaotic. Every girl felt like she was supposed to get a red rose from someone.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> When you meet someone are you supposed to shake their hand?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span>  Yes, but mostly  people just greet each other without physical contact. On Valentine's day, however, there may be more public displays of affection than usual!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Let's drop the subject of Valentine's day."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [], "_data": [], "id": 2, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}